# One person, one identity.
#
# 89 of the commits in this history were authored as "Matthew Parker" and 211
# as "SysAdminDoc", both from the same address, so GitHub counted two
# contributors for one author. History cannot be rewritten to fix it: branch
# protection on this repository refuses force-push, and taking the protection
# off to correct a name is not a trade worth making. A mailmap fixes every
# `git log`, `git shortlog` and contributor view without touching a commit.
#
# Add to this file rather than replacing it if another spelling ever appears.
SysAdminDoc <matt_parker@outlook.com> Matthew Parker <matt_parker@outlook.com>
